# The certificate verifier's Android component (rustls-platform-verifier's Kotlin, which reqwest's checks call
# through JNI): the AAR org.rustls:rustls-platform-verifier of the version Cargo.lock's rustls-platform-verifier-android
# is, from the Maven repository the project keeps on its GitHub branch maven-archive, checked by its SHA-256.
# packaging/android/package.sh downloads it; when Cargo.lock moves to another version, pin that one's here.
